00 height=150 /></span>Yuri Kissaten is a new game studio dedicated to making games about girls who love girls. This is our first release! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main minds behind this game are: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Bea Baker, the creator of popular internet books like <i>The Gay Gatsby</i> and <i>Hands Held in the Snow</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fruz, webcomic artist, video editor, and world-renowned Among Us fan artist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >linguisticspaceship, programmer galore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy all our very gay games!</p>",
